  "construction": "Weight-4 bicycle (generalized toric code) on the twisted torus Z_7 x Z_14, f = 1 + y, g = 1 + xy. Member r=7 of the [[4r^2, 2, 2r]] family, for which d = 2r is exact: a logical is a closed path of p steps (0,1) and q steps (1,1) with q = 0 mod 7 and p + q = 0 mod 14, of weight |p| + |q|, minimised at 14. Found with Claude Opus 5.",
